The comparison core in this directory is adapted from imuratalpay/ui-diff
(https://github.com/imuratalpay/ui-diff) at commit
3075b4c8bbbf1a352404829f84f64c26cba291e5, package `skills/ui-diff`.

Adapted files: `diff.ts` (from src/diff.ts), `align.ts` (from src/align.ts),
`image.ts` (from src/image.ts), `font.ts` (from src/font.ts). Only the comparator
path is taken. Capture, publishing and network code are not part of this tree.

Upstream license follows, unchanged.

